WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.880
Businesses don't need more AI experiments.

2
00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:05.660
They need AI that works. Meet ColleagueAI.

3
00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:08.541
We build AI agents: software
that carries out defined

4
00:00:08.541 --> 00:00:11.810
business tasks for your team,
with rules and human oversight.

5
00:00:11.850 --> 00:00:16.570
Agents support finance, operations,
risk, compliance and legal work.

6
00:00:16.610 --> 00:00:20.967
For a finance review, the agent analyses
business documents and transactions,

7
00:00:20.967 --> 00:00:25.210
flags exceptions and prepares issues
to check, with the proposed next step.

8
00:00:25.250 --> 00:00:29.222
The agent works inside your Microsoft
environment, using only the information

9
00:00:29.222 --> 00:00:33.090
it is allowed to access. Your business
data stays within your organisation.

10
00:00:33.130 --> 00:00:35.501
When approval is needed,
your team decides.

11
00:00:35.501 --> 00:00:39.140
Each action and approval is recorded,
so you can see what happens.

12
00:00:39.460 --> 00:00:41.090
Think about your next finance review.

13
00:00:41.130 --> 00:00:43.313
Instead of checking
every document by hand,

14
00:00:43.313 --> 00:00:46.460
your team starts with flagged
issues and a proposed next step.

15
00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:48.220
You decide what happens next.

16
00:00:48.260 --> 00:00:50.590
Pick one task that slows your team down.

17
00:00:50.630 --> 00:00:52.610
The checks. The follow-ups.

18
00:00:52.650 --> 00:00:54.490
The same work, every week.

19
00:00:54.530 --> 00:00:57.025
Let your ColleagueAI
agent prepare the work,

20
00:00:57.025 --> 00:01:00.030
flag the issues and bring
the next step to your team.

21
00:01:00.070 --> 00:01:01.530
You stay in control.

22
00:01:01.570 --> 00:01:03.360
Your team moves forward.

23
00:01:03.400 --> 00:01:04.670
ColleagueAI.

24
00:01:04.710 --> 00:01:06.820
Put your next task in motion.
